  "title": "US Supreme Court Clears Way for Christa Pike’s Execution in Tennessee",
  "summary": "The US Supreme Court cleared the way for Christa Pike’s execution in Tennessee, with the court ruling that the evidence was sufficient to proceed, despite a previous stay that had stalled the execution 200 years ago. The case highlights ongoing legal battles over a woman’s rights to life.",
